   "file": "content/FMA_44248/tier1.auto.md",
   "text": "Plantar tarsal ligament, each intstance of which is a ligament arising from the lower surface of some calcaneus as far back as the lateral and the medial processes, passing forward over the tendon of some fibularis longus, and inserting into the bases of some second through fifth metatarsal bones.",
